the <abb>CIDS</abb> function.</para><para layer="1" lid="N.00007619.0002001.015">Refer to <abb>AMM</abb> TASK 23-73-00-040-001.</para></item></numlist></note></remark></normal-dispcond></dispcond></ditembody></dispatchitem>